## Softaworks / Leonardo Flores references and adaptations — MIT License

Source repository: <https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit>

Commit consulted: `3027f20f3181758385a1bb8c022d4041dfb4de84`
(2026-03-05). The adapted source skills are MIT-licensed.

| Source skill | Quasar scope and modifications |
|---|---|
| [`game-changing-features`](https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit/tree/3027f20f3181758385a1bb8c022d4041dfb4de84/skills/game-changing-features) | `skills/ideation/q-ideation-session/references/opportunity-discovery.md` and three criteria in `references/profile-product.md`. Quasar retained divergence scaffolding, three effort/impact scales, ten coverage categories, and unsticking prompts while replacing emoji scores, stack-rank decisions, in-session investigation, output paths, and “10x” branding with evidence requests, declared criteria, gates, and owner dispositions. |
| [`humanizer`](https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit/tree/3027f20f3181758385a1bb8c022d4041dfb4de84/skills/humanizer) and [`writing-clearly-and-concisely`](https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit/tree/3027f20f3181758385a1bb8c022d4041dfb4de84/skills/writing-clearly-and-concisely) | `skills/tool/q-tool-humanizer/SKILL.md` and `references/patterns-en.md`, `patterns-es.md`, `clarity-en.md`, and `clarity-es.md`. Quasar split detection, rewrite, and improvement; added English/Spanish routing, meaning-preservation and bounded-write rules; replaced authorship verdicts with localized indicators; and rewrote examples. Invocation metadata is original Quasar work. The upstream `humanizer` credits the original skill by [@blader](https://github.com/blader/humanizer). |
| [`skill-judge`](https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit/tree/3027f20f3181758385a1bb8c022d4041dfb4de84/skills/skill-judge) | `skills/review/q-review-skill/SKILL.md`. Quasar retained the useful context-value, progressive-disclosure, freedom-calibration, and practical-usability lenses while replacing the fixed score and universal assumptions with evidence, severity, target authority, and behavioral checks. No source text, grading table, or code was incorporated. |
| [`c4-architecture`](https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit/tree/3027f20f3181758385a1bb8c022d4041dfb4de84/skills/c4-architecture) | `skills/tool/q-tool-c4/SKILL.md`. The original Quasar implementation was conceptually informed by the source, then verified against official C4 and renderer documentation. No source text, template, or code was incorporated. |
| [`design-system-starter`](https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit/tree/3027f20f3181758385a1bb8c022d4041dfb4de84/skills/design-system-starter) | `skills/plan/q-plan-design-system/SKILL.md`. The source motivated the capability; Quasar rewrote it against its own planning, authority, artifact, validation, and lifecycle contracts. No source text, checklist, template, or code was incorporated. |

